<title>USA: CrossComm names Douglas Bryant CFO.</title>
<headline>CrossComm names Douglas Bryant CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBOROUGH, Mass. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CrossComm Corp said on Wednesday it had named Douglas Bryant to the post of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Bryant has been serving as Acting CFO since July 1996, the company said.  Before that, he was corporate controller.</p>
<p>CrossCom's previous CFO, Allan Kline, left the company in June.</p>
